                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.003/418: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-15T16:00:00-04:00">September 15, 1930—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>322. Your 813, September 15, noon. Authorization granted. Has presentation of
                    draft by the British Minister received any publicity?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
